haracterName":"国見 佐彩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryou's classmate and one of the top-ranking students in the school (in terms of grades). She is popular with boys and the teachers trust her a lot. Because she keeps her private life enveloped in a veil of mystery and rarely goes out with her friends, girls who are jealous of her have been circulating rumors of Saya participating in compensated dating."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Saya is the biological child of the killer, and is the one spraying graffiti across the town. She dies in Akemi's route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65159"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校３年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学年一の優等生であり、クラスメイトだけでなく先生からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子からの人気も高いが、恋人がいるという話は一切ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後に友達と遊んだりする事はほとんどないようで、プライベートは謎に包まれているが、 彼女の人気に嫉妬している一部の女子には援助交際の疑惑を持たれてる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒と関係を持つようになってからはまるで自分を傷つけるようにセックスをするが、 どこかセックスという行為をバカにしている所があり、優等生とは違う一面があるようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17967","sourceWorkId":"25917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学年一の優等生であり、クラスメイトだけでなく先生からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子からの人気も高いが、恋人がいるという話は一切ない。放課後に友達と遊んだりする事はほとんどないようで、プライベートは謎に包まれているが、彼女の人気に嫉妬している一部の女子には援助交際の疑惑を持たれてる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒と関係を持つようになってからはまるで自分を傷つけるようにセックスをするが、どこかセックスという行為をバカにしている所があり、優等生とは違う一面があるようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「間抜けな顔して腰振って……本当、バカみたい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58931"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8df51939114062b5d799303980a1579340a4e7fdc2cc8db3dbdab0e8e224731c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebfa598b0e194a4b71e6ae1792296d8205025246abe4db0bc24873b43bc738a4.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226286:58931:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65160","characterName":"東照宮 朱美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58932","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226286"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17968"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65160"},"originalCharacterName":"東照宮 朱美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A rich girl in class 3-A with excellent grades, is very popular with the boys and also admired by the girls in the school, Akemi does not brag about her status as a super rich girl and instead is very polite and friendly. She is very competitive with Saya in regards to their examination rankings."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65160"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校３年A組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金持ちのお嬢様で、成績も優秀、男子からの人気もあり取り巻きの女子からの尊敬を集めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はその事を自慢したりするような事は一切なく、礼儀正しく、誰に対しても優しいが、何故か佐彩に対しては敵対心を露わにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"塾帰りにいつもと違う路地をたまたま通ると、そこで佐彩と諒がセックスをしているのを目撃してしまう。その事がきっかけで諒に近くが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17968","sourceWorkId":"25917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校3年A組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金持ちのお嬢様で、成績も優秀、男子からの人気もあり取り巻きの女子からの尊敬を集めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はその事を自慢したりするような事は一切なく、礼儀正しく、誰に対しても優しいが、何故か佐彩に対しては敵対心を露わにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"塾帰りにいつもと違う路地をたまたま通ると、そこで佐彩と諒がセックスをしているのを目撃してしまう。その事がきっかけで諒に近くが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「王子様みたいな素敵な人に初めてを……って思ってたのに」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58932"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e81a16fdb6e38bdc20c3ddcadde715761e926c10b3a304949e614e82c4f2834.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1562a0e3c30a621a051b02721fedcf893ea45baf33bc97d6f1b7d4a3c9d0c226.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226286:58932:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65161","characterName":"愛子 奈々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58933","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226286"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17969"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65161"},"originalCharacterName":"愛子 奈々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryou's classmate and an ordinary girl with average grades. She has been in love with Ryou ever since the first year of high school, but her heart got broken as she found out he was dating Chitose. After Chitose' death however, she started comforting him through sex."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65161"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校３年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスでも少し地味な女子のグループに属していて、成績も中くらいの普通の女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学当初から諒の事を好きになってしまったが、千歳という恋人の存在を知って失恋した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、千歳がある事件により亡くなってしまい、諒を慰めようと接する内にセックスをしてしまう。それ以降セフレのような関係になってしまうが、本人はそれでもいいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17969","sourceWorkId":"25917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東五橋学校3年B組"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスでも少し地味な女子のグループに属していて、成績も中くらいの普通の女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学当初から諒の事を好きになってしまったが、千歳という恋人の存在を知って失恋した。しかし、千歳がある事件により亡くなってしまい、諒を慰めようと接する内にセックスをしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以降セフレのような関係になってしまうが、本人はそれでもいいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「エッチの時だけでも一緒に居られて嬉しいよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58933"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c91d41a3d49860f186a0ffc4d9c0e176f5c6906b3d61649ba3d9ac4ec6b3e402.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e21e65302120c3c52dbe319b608d3a0864f01e5941521afb997904c8c8be5c47.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226286:58933:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65162","characterName":"北山 諒","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65162"},"originalCharacterName":"北山 諒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist whose lover Chitose died two years prior to the game's events. He used to have excellent grades and be quite proficient at sports, and was admired by everyone, but after Chitose's death, he lost his goal in life completely."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65162"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb2cf276a3959a521925647a31b5b1c7f7d8e6461b0a5dde19e7ba6fc830ea20.webp","fal